WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:05,990
Get dressed up while you still have time.

2
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:07,870
Show your kindness to a goddess like you

3
00:00:08,390 --> 00:00:09,790
Lin Dong will definitely not refuse

4
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:11,500
This can't be done

5
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,580
What if Lin Dong gets entangled with me?

6
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:15,220
Although she is tall

7
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:16,260
Still a little handsome

8
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:19,580
But poor Xiaoyu

9
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:21,740
Now is an extraordinary moment

10
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,780
Just a little sacrifice

11
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:26,660
If it doesn't work, I'll do it

12
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:31,870
Why don't you talk anymore?

13
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:35,810
I still can't accept it

14
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:37,170
How about Sister Ying come on?

15
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:39,170
After all, Sister Ying should dress up a little bit

16
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:40,890
That's also a joke

17
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:44,160
I can't do it, you can do it

18
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:45,520
I believe you, sister Ying

19
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:51,320
I think I can do it too, okay?

20
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:53,000
I'll make a sacrifice

21
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:54,200
But don't worry

22
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:55,800
As long as I take down Lin Dong

23
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:57,560
I will definitely take you two with me

24
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:58,880
Without Zhao Yufei

25
00:00:59,790 --> 00:01:01,790
The three of us are good sisters for life

26
00:01:03,740 --> 00:01:07,460
The three of us are truly good sisters, right?

27
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:09,020
I really think I can do it too
